#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "clog2, clog2f, clog2l - base-2 logarithm of a complex number"
msgstr "clog2, clog2f, clog2l - логарифм по основанию 2 комплексного числа"

